1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,542
Three machines download the
same update three times?

2
00:00:04,142 --> 00:00:07,384
Cache & Carry downloads it
once from the internet.

3
00:00:07,484 --> 00:00:09,785
All the others get it from your network.

4
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:13,458
Machine one gets the
package from the internet.

5
00:00:13,808 --> 00:00:16,485
Machine two gets it
straight from the cache.

6
00:00:17,685 --> 00:00:19,890
There are three ways to install it:

7
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:22,446
Proxmox VE with one command.

8
00:00:22,546 --> 00:00:24,132
As a Docker image.

9
00:00:24,232 --> 00:00:26,835
Or as a package for Debian and Ubuntu.

10
00:00:27,835 --> 00:00:30,810
Free and open source. Link in bio.

11
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,026
Follow for more homelab tips.
